# Accepted vulnerabilities — see each entry's justification.
#
# Trivy scans the full image, including the system Python shipped by the
# python:3.14-slim-bookworm base image. The app runs entirely from
# /app/.venv and never executes the system Python's build-time tooling, so
# the following base-image findings are not part of the runtime attack
# surface. They disappear on the next base-image bump.

# msgpack 1.1.2 (base-image system Python). Out-of-bounds read on Unpacker
# reuse. Build-time package only; the app's own dependency graph resolves
# msgpack 1.2.1 (and only under the dev group). Fixed in 1.2.1.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# setuptools 70.3.0 (base-image system Python). Path traversal in
# PackageIndex. Install-time tool only; no package installation happens at
# runtime. The app's own graph pins setuptools 83.0.0 (dev group). Fixed in
# 78.1.1.
CVE-2025-47273
